; One bare integer inside a trigger :at vector: the manifest types :at
; as time-pos-list, so the element itself fails validation with a span —
; the compile never walks the table, and the builder's position readers
; (numberWithUnitOf) never see a bare number. Final-review I1 corpus
; pin (binary01-fc): the language-visible error is the validator's own
; words, on the offending element.
(transport :bpm 120 :meter [4 4])

(trigger :target radius :at [4b 1 8b])
